      "principle": "The burden lies on the accused to prove that the confession was not voluntary.",
      "held": "It is well settled that the burden lies on the accused to prove that the confession was not voluntary and that the prosecution has discharged its duty if it shows that the confession was made after the accused had been arrested and was in a position to make a free confession.",
