      "principle": "The law is clear that a confession made by an accused person after arrest and in custody is not voluntary.",
      "held": "It is well settled that the law is clear that a confession made by an accused person after arrest and in custody is not voluntary unless it is shown that there was no undue influence or pressure exercised on him to make the confession.",
